Gothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">월에 신청한 전공배정 신청 내역 확인</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">변경신청 사항</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">배정 희망 전공</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">입력 후 저장</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ※</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;건축학부 내 2개 전공을 희망 전공순으로 모두 입력 후 저장하여야 함</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family